@startuml
title 点选纠错时序图（Proma Core 对齐 v1.1）

actor User as U
participant "PreviewPanel\n(Renderer)" as Preview
participant "PreviewInteractionLayer" as Layer
participant "PointCorrectionPopover" as Popover
participant "Jotai Agent Atoms" as Atoms
participant "preload/bridge.ts" as Bridge
participant "main/ipc.ts" as IPC
participant "GuideAgentService" as Guide
participant "AgentOrchestrator" as AO
participant "ProgrammingOrchestrator" as Prog
participant "SandboxRuntime" as Sandbox
participant "GWTTestRunner" as Test
participant "SnapshotManager" as Snapshot
participant "LocalFirstStore" as Store
participant "AnalyticsCollector" as Analytics

U -> Preview: 点击不满意元素
Preview -> Layer: captureClick(event)
Layer --> Preview: highlight(target)
Layer -> Popover: open(correctionContext)
Popover --> U: 显示“这里有什么问题？”

alt 用户输入说明
  U -> Popover: submit(note)
else 用户点击“你猜”
  U -> Popover: guess()
end

Popover -> Bridge: electronAPI.project.submitCorrection(context)
Bridge -> IPC: invoke(point correction channel)
IPC -> IPC: validate correction payload
IPC -> Store: appendJsonl(correction event)
IPC -> Guide: interpretCorrection(context)
Guide --> IPC: revision request + user visible acknowledgement
IPC -> Bridge: push AgentEvent(correction_received)
Bridge -> Atoms: update atomFamily(sessionId)
Atoms -> Preview: render status
Preview --> U: 已收到修改意见

Guide -> AO: query(sessionId, revision prompt)
AO -> Prog: execute revision task
Prog -> Sandbox: apply changes
Prog -> Test: run related GWT

alt 测试通过
  Test --> Prog: passed
  Prog -> Snapshot: create(kind=iteration)
  Snapshot -> Store: write snapshot metadata and files
  Prog -> Analytics: track(point_correction)
  Prog --> IPC: AgentEvent(iteration_ready)
  IPC -> Bridge: push AgentEvent
  Bridge -> Atoms: update session state
  Atoms -> Preview: refresh preview
  Preview --> U: 刷新预览
else 测试失败
  Test --> Prog: failed
  loop max 3 repair attempts
    Prog -> Prog: repair
    Prog -> Sandbox: apply fix and rerun
    Prog -> Test: run related GWT
  end
  Prog --> IPC: AgentEvent(repairing or ask_user)
  IPC -> Bridge: push AgentEvent
  Bridge -> Atoms: update status
end

@enduml
